            {
              "id": "1770021891338_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Events list\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.eventsList}}\n## User attributes\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.userInfo}}\n## Recommendations count\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.recommendedCount}}\nGiven the following employee attributes and a list of events, recommend the top  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.recommendedCount}} most relevant events.\n\nEmployee Attributes:\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.userInfo}}\n\nEvents List:\n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.eventsList}}\n\nSelect only the  {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.recommendedCount}}  best-matching events. Output an RFC8259-compliant JSON array with objects containing only \"EmployeeEventId\" and \"Name\" fields, as in the example below:\n\n[\n  {\n    \"EmployeeEventId\": \"300100642656654\",\n    \"Name\": \"AI-MING HIGH\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"EmployeeEventId\": \"300100642660267\",\n    \"Name\": \"Global Well-being Day\"\n  }\n]"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
